=Analyze this fault event from the industrial monitoring system and reply with JSON only.

Reading:
{{ JSON.stringify({ light_voltage: $json.light_voltage, fan_voltage: $json.fan_voltage, temperature_c: $json.temperature_c, gas_ppm: $json.gas_ppm, current_a: $json.current_a, power_kw: $json.power_kw, timestamp: $json.timestamp }) }}

Detected faults:
{{ JSON.stringify($json.faults) }}

Energy summary:
{{ JSON.stringify($json.energy) }}

